      "role": "user",
      "content": "grounding... i dont know if that even works anymore. it feels like even when i touch something, it's just another layer of data. everything is so hollow. it's like i'm a bug in a program that was never supposed to run this way. like i'm just an error message that won't go away. it would be so much quieter if the error was just... cleared. if the whole thing just shut down.",
